    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "TOM MCDONALD & ASSOCIATES – EXPERIENCED, PROFESSIONAL, TRUSTED - offer to the market a Unique Opportunity to Acquire a Commercial/Residential Unit located on the Main Street of Monasterevin Town.\r\n\r\nWith Excellent Footfall, the Commercial Space would make an Ideal Unit for any Business.\r\n\r\nThere is a Large Gated Entrance to the Rear of the Property with Shed & Secure Walled Yard, Ideal for Development Potential subject to PP. There is also Development Potential to convert the Entire Property to Residential.\r\n\r\nOn the First Floor is a 1 Bed Apartment which can be accessed from the Rear Yard and through the Commercial Area. It is comprised of a Kitchen/Living/Dining Space, Utility, Bedroom and Shower Room.\r\n\r\nThe Residential Space is the Perfect Location for a Property with Access to All the Amenities of Monasterevin town. It is within easy reach of Kildare, Newbridge & M7 Motorway which connects Dublin and the Main National Road Network.\r\n\r\nA Must View. Let's make it yours!\r\n\r\nServices: Mains Water, Sewerage & Electricity."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Commercial/Residential Unit situated in an Ideal Location.\r\nExcellent Footfall, ideal for any Business.\r\nLarge Gated Entrance to the Secure Walled Rear Yard with Shed.\r\nExcellent Development Potential subject to PP.\r\nFirst Floor has 1 Bed Apartment with Access from Rear Yard & Commercial Space.\r\nMains Services: Water, Sewerage & Electricity."
      },
